{"data":{"type":"template","attributes":{"name":"[DRAFT DnD] SOL KYST | Welcome 6 - Note from Meghan","editor_type":"SYSTEM_DRAGGABLE","definition":{"body":{"properties":{},"styles":{"background_color":"#FFFFFF","width":600},"sections":[{"content_type":"section","type":"section","data":{"properties":{},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"background_color":"#FFFFFF","inner_padding_top":24,"inner_padding_right":20,"inner_padding_bottom":24,"inner_padding_left":20,"stack_on_mobile":true}},"rows":[{"data":{"styles":{"column_layout":"1-column-full-width"}},"columns":[{"blocks":[{"content_type":"block","type":"text","data":{"content":"<p style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#222222;margin:0 0 16px\">Hi {{ first_name|default:'' }},</p><p style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#222222;margin:0 0 16px\">It&#39;s Meghan again. Quick one, I promise.</p><p style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#222222;margin:0 0 16px\">I&#39;ll be honest, I&#39;m not great at the salesy stuff. I&#39;d rather just talk to you.</p><p style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#222222;margin:0 0 16px\">If you&#39;ve been eyeing a pair but something&#39;s holding you back, I&#39;d genuinely love to know what it is. The size? The price? Not sure what&#39;ll suit your face? <b>Just hit reply and tell me.</b> I read these, and I&#39;ll help you figure it out, even if the answer is that we&#39;re not the right fit for you.</p><p style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#222222;margin:0 0 16px\">Or send me a selfie (straight on, hair back) and I&#39;ll tell you your size. That&#39;s honestly one of my favourite parts of this job.</p><p style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#222222;margin:0 0 16px\">Your 15% off is still here whenever you&#39;re ready: <a href=\"https://www.solkyst.ca/discount/kystfortheveryfirsttime?redirect=/collections/all\" style=\"color:#3B2C27\"><b>KYSTFORTHEVERYFIRSTTIME</b></a> (it applies automatically when you tap).</p><p style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#222222;margin:0 0 16px\">Let&#39;s get you Kyst,<br>Meghan<br>Founder, SOL KYST</p><p style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#222222;margin:0 0 16px\">P.S. Running a small company means wearing a lot of hats. Reading your emails is my favourite one.</p><p style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#999999;margin:40px 0 0\">{{ organization.name }} &middot; {{ organization.full_address }} &middot; {% unsubscribe 'Unsubscribe' %}</p>","display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"block_padding_top":0,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":0,"block_padding_left":0}}}]}]}]}]},"styles":[{"style_type":"base-styles","properties":{"mobile_optimizations":true},"styles":{"content_background_color":"#FFFFFF","margin_top":0}},{"style_type":"text-styles","styles":{"color":"#1E1512","font_family":"'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","font_size":16,"line_height":1.65}},{"style_type":"heading-1-styles","styles":{"color":"#1E1512","font_family":"Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif","font_size":34,"font_style":"italic","font_weight":"400"}},{"style_type":"heading-2-styles","styles":{"color":"#1E1512","font_family":"Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif","font_size":28,"font_style":"italic","font_weight":"400"}},{"style_type":"heading-3-styles","styles":{"color":"#1E1512","font_family":"Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif","font_size":22,"font_style":"italic","font_weight":"400"}},{"style_type":"heading-4-styles","styles":{"color":"#6B6460","font_family":"'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","font_size":11,"font_weight":"600","letter_spacing":3}},{"style_type":"link-styles","styles":{"color":"#3B2C27","text_decoration":"underline"}},{"style_type":"mobile-styles","properties":{"mobile_padding_override":false},"styles":{}}]}}}}